WEBVTT FILE

1
00:38.499 --> 00:40.719
I will miss you very much.

2
00:40.743 --> 00:46.306
But I will write you every day.

3
00:46.330 --> 00:51.969
Where can I write to you in Oregon?

4
00:56.018 --> 00:59.624
I ain't going to Oregon.

5
00:59.649 --> 01:02.284
But you must go.

6
01:02.309 --> 01:06.986
I don't want to keep you from your work.

7
01:07.699 --> 01:10.970
I don't have no work.

8
01:10.994 --> 01:15.267
I make my living robbing banks.

9
01:15.291 --> 01:18.348
What do you mean?

10
01:20.004 --> 01:22.817
I mean that...

11
01:22.841 --> 01:27.795
everything I told you about last night was lies.

12
01:29.349 --> 01:34.017
You lie?

13
01:36.357 --> 01:40.858
Yeah.

14
01:41.529 --> 01:45.426
About everything?

15
01:45.450 --> 01:50.035
Yeah, just about.

16
02:05.557 --> 02:09.704
But your mother's necklace...

17
02:09.728 --> 02:12.456
True?

18
02:12.480 --> 02:16.253
I never knew nothing about my mother.

19
02:16.277 --> 02:23.115
I bought that thing off a girl for 25 bucks.

20
02:24.244 --> 02:27.933
Well...

21
02:27.957 --> 02:31.979
That's about it.

22
02:32.003 --> 02:35.483
It ain't gonna help much to say it, but...

23
02:35.507 --> 02:40.071
I shamed you.

24
02:40.095 --> 02:45.097
I wish to God I hadn't.

25
02:47.479 --> 02:51.791
You only shame yourself.

26
04:59.152 --> 05:01.339
Scare ya?

27
05:01.364 --> 05:02.819
Out kinda late, huh?

28
05:02.844 --> 05:05.205
What are you doing here?

29
05:05.230 --> 05:07.645
I reckon I know where you been.

30
05:07.670 --> 05:10.200
I was just walking.

31
05:10.534 --> 05:13.989
Let's take a little walk, you and me.

32
05:14.033 --> 05:17.957
One more ain't gonna make no difference.

33
05:20.708 --> 05:25.710
Get out of my way.

34
06:01.489 --> 06:03.671
Dad.

35
06:03.696 --> 06:06.180
Dad!

36
06:06.204 --> 06:10.789
It's me, Lon.

37
06:25.386 --> 06:32.015
I sure am sorry to get you up this early, Dad.

38
06:33.794 --> 06:36.965
I hate to tell you this.

39
06:36.990 --> 06:40.301
She's been out all night.

40
06:40.326 --> 06:42.096
Who?

41
06:42.120 --> 06:44.369
Louisa.

42
06:44.394 --> 06:49.634
With that Rio fella.

43
06:56.386 --> 06:59.363
How do you know, Lon?

44
06:59.388 --> 07:02.257
I've been round here half the night,

45
07:02.281 --> 07:04.230
and she just this minute come home.

46
07:04.255 --> 07:08.125
Looking kinda messy too.

47
07:08.163 --> 07:15.293
I sure hate to be the one to... the one to tell you, Dad.

48
07:48.487 --> 07:52.453
Lon tells me that, uh...

49
07:52.478 --> 07:56.658
you were out with Rio all night. Is that true?

50
07:58.540 --> 08:00.791
No.

51
08:00.816 --> 08:04.477
Then why are you still dressed? Why hasn't your bed been slept in?

52
08:04.502 --> 08:07.074
Hmm?

53
08:07.099 --> 08:09.248
Answer me!

54
08:09.273 --> 08:11.197
Were you with him?

55
08:11.221 --> 08:13.616
Yes, but... but...

56
08:13.640 --> 08:16.379
But what? What? What?

57
08:16.404 --> 08:19.205
- Nothing happened. - Don't you lie to me!

58
08:19.230 --> 08:21.017
I'm not lying to you!

59
08:21.041 --> 08:22.557
We just walked on the beach!

60
08:22.582 --> 08:24.564
- That's all? You just walked on the beach? - Yes!

61
08:24.589 --> 08:27.237
We just walked on the beach! I swear that! - What's the matter?

62
08:27.262 --> 08:31.053
What's happened here? What is it?

63
08:31.077 --> 08:34.974
Louisa, what happened?

64
08:34.998 --> 08:42.003
Mother, I want to speak to you for a moment.

65
08:42.882 --> 08:47.488
Louisa, what happened?

66
08:47.512 --> 08:50.491
¿Qué hiciste en toda la noche?

67
08:50.515 --> 08:52.911
¿Te pasó algo?

68
08:53.383 --> 08:55.484
¡Contesta!

69
08:55.509 --> 08:58.329
Mother, I'm waiting!

70
09:10.747 --> 09:14.477
I think she's lying to me, and I want you to find out.

71
09:14.502 --> 09:16.797
Louisa would never lie.

72
09:16.822 --> 09:21.255
I hope you're right.

73
09:29.887 --> 09:34.833
Louisa. ¿Es verdad?

74
09:34.857 --> 09:39.776
¿Te fuiste con él?

75
09:42.699 --> 09:46.055
¿Por qué, Louisa?

76
09:46.079 --> 09:49.308
¿Por qué lo hiciste?

77
09:49.332 --> 09:53.029
Porque yo creí que él me quería.

78
09:53.054 --> 09:57.588
Y era mentira.

79
10:15.070 --> 10:18.716
Perdóname, mamá.

80
10:18.740 --> 10:22.388
Perdóname.

81
10:22.412 --> 10:26.913
Hija.

82
10:34.216 --> 10:39.240
Was she telling the truth?

83
10:39.264 --> 10:41.117
Yes.

84
10:41.141 --> 10:45.679
- Are you sure? - Yes.

85
10:45.704 --> 10:47.979
But she was out with him all night.

86
10:48.004 --> 10:51.546
She's alright.

87
10:51.570 --> 10:56.947
You keep her in her room.